🛒 Sales Analysis — Products Sold Only in Q1 2019

📌 Problem Statement

Write a SQL query to find all products that were sold only between January 1, 2019 and March 31, 2019.

Return:

product_id

product_name

A product qualifies only if:

Its first sale was on or after 2019-01-01

Its last sale was on or before 2019-03-31

In other words, every sale of the product must have occurred during Q1 2019.

